369
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:42,089
歌洛莉亚 我刚才换了下一个航班
Gloria, I just switched us to the next flight.

370
00:12:42,089 --> 00:12:44,160
你们的事情都解决了吧
Now, did you guys get everything straightened out?

371
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:45,340
克莱尔心情不好
