还毁了我对靴子的爱
and boots.

453
00:15:25,180 --> 00:15:26,140
用得还顺手吧
Working okay for you?

454
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:26,940
对 对
Oh, yes.

455
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:30,300
我在给在哥伦比亚的兄弟发邮件
I was sending an e-mail to my brother in Colombia.

456
00:15:31,541 --> 00:15:33,840
我在给他介绍克莱尔
Um, I was telling him about Claire.

457
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:37,560
我发现我还真是太不了解她了
You know, I realize there's so much I don't know about her.

458
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:41,140
像是 她最喜欢哪个单词
Like, for example, what is her favorite word?

459
00:15:41,260 --> 00:15:44,340
