and this is one of those moments.

506
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:30,480
实在抱歉 我这么久才回来
Oh, guys, I'm so sorry that took so long.

507
00:17:30,660 --> 00:17:33,040
天啊 这是怎么回事呀
