512
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:41,740
-天啊 天啊 -我们真是一对烂人呀
- Oh, my god. Oh, my god! - We are horrible people.

513
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:42,780
我只是跟着你说而已
I'm only following your lead.

514
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:44,420
是啊 还不忘在旁边添油加醋
Yeah, so close that you stepped on the back of my shoe.

515
00:17:44,420 --> 00:17:46,680
-过来 杰克逊对草莓过敏 -什么
- Come here. Jackson's allergic to strawberries. - What?

516
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,380
他的喉咙会堵住
His throat will close up,

517
00:17:47,380 --> 00:17:48,580
