and he can go into anaphylactic shock.

518
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:49,940
我必须马上给他打针
I need to inject him right now!

519
00:17:49,940 --> 00:17:51,760
你确定吗 我觉得他挺好的呀
Oh! Are you sure? He seems all right to me.

520
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:52,940
是啊 也许让他呼吸点新鲜空气就没事了
Yeah, maybe just get him some fresh air.

521
00:17:53,060 --> 00:17:54,960
别说了 他很讨厌打针
Stop talking! He really hates this.

522
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:55,680
所以我要你们俩
And so I'm gonna need you

523
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:57,480
帮我按住他的胳膊和腿 好吗
to help me pin down his arms and his legs, okay?

524
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,680
-实际上 -杰克逊 宝贝儿
- You know what? - Jackson, honey,

525
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,060
很抱歉妈妈不得不这么做
mommy's so sorry to have to do this,

526
00:18:00,060 --> 00:18:01,300
-阿米莉亚 -但是只会疼一下而已
- Amelia -- - but it's only gonna hurt for a second.

527
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:02,040
快按住他的胳膊
His arms!!

528
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:04,140
好的 快点 准备打了
Okay. Hurry. Here we go.

529
00:18:04,140 --> 00:18:05,760
一 二
One, two --

